# --- Plugins ---
# No plugin ships as source in this repo anymore -- every one (the
# first-party "official" catalog plugins, the still-unfinished beta ones,
# and any third-party plugin installed via zip/GitHub) lives in the writable
# plugins dir instead (plugins._user_plugins_dir(), which for a source
# checkout resolves to this same physical plugins/ folder -- BASE_DIR is the
# project root here). Only plugins/__init__.py itself is ever tracked, so a
# blanket subdirectory ignore covers every current AND future plugin id
# without needing a new entry each time one's installed for local testing.
plugins/*/

